<title>UK: UK grain futures closed down, tracking CBOT wheat.</title>
<headline>UK grain futures closed down, tracking CBOT wheat.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-10-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>UK grain futures closed lower as they followed the trend set by CBOT grain futures in early afternoon trade.</p>
<p>Wheat futures closed 0.70 to 1.00 stg down after trading 503 lots while barley was slightly steadier at just 0.10 to 0.15 stg easier after trading 58 lots.</p>
<p>Business on the delivered market remained subdued, with selling levels around one stg down in line with the wheat futures.</p>
<p>--London Newsroom +44 171 542 8074</p>
